{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17262","headline":"奉送孔十兄宾客承恩致政归东都旧居 · 权德舆","name":"奉送孔十兄宾客承恩致政归东都旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"达人旷迹通出处，每忆安居旧山去。\n乞身已见抗疏频，优礼新闻诏书许。\n家法遥传阙里训，心源早逐嵩丘侣。\n南史编年着盛名，东朝侍讲常虚伫。\n角巾华发忽自遂，命服金龟君更与。\n白云出岫暂逶迤，鸿鹄入冥无处所。\n归路依依童稚乐，都门蔼蔼壶觞举。\n能将此道助皇风，自可殊途并伊吕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17262.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17262","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}